  "intro": {
    "text": "*Ali hastaydı* means you know Ali was ill. *Ali hastaymış* means you heard it or found out: **Ali is (or was) ill, apparently**. `-(y)mIş` takes the endings of the present: *hastaymışım*. It also marks a discovery: *Bu çorba çok güzelmiş!*",
    "see": "gp-idi-imis"
  },
